  "body": "Let's start a conversation about your Next Chapter!\r\n\r\nA change in circumstances creates a genuine opportunity for buyers ready to make a move.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are relocating and are motivated to sell, with clear instructions to negotiate. Set on a substantial 1,059m² (more or less) freehold site, this spacious Torbay property offers the land, flexibility and location that many buyers are looking for.\r\n\r\nNow being offered by Negotiation, all serious offers will be considered.\r\n\r\nSet in a sought-after coastal community and close to beaches, schools, parks, shopping and transport, 142 Weatherly Road presents an opportunity to secure a substantial family home with generous grounds and plenty of flexibility.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n\r\n* Freehold 1,059m² (more or less) section\r\n* Approximately 260m² home (more or less)\r\n* Three well-proportioned bedrooms\r\n* Main family bathroom plus additional downstairs amenities\r\n* Multiple living and flexible-use spaces\r\n* Generous outdoor areas for entertaining and family enjoyment\r\n* Convenient off-street parking\r\n* Close to Torbay Village, Browns Bay, beaches, schools, parks and amenities\r\n\r\nThe approximately 260m² home provides a practical and versatile layout, with multiple living areas and spaces that can adapt to changing family needs. The generous grounds provide plenty of room for children, pets, entertaining, gardening or simply enjoying the space that comes with a substantial section.\r\n\r\nThe vendors' next move is already underway. Their priority is to secure a sale and move forward with their relocation.\r\n\r\nIf you've previously considered this property, now is the time to take another look.\r\n\r\nContact Mayad Rassam for further information or to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nProperty files: View property files",
